The device, however, is not yet available on the Spanish market in any commercial solution, even if it has already been experimentally introduced in some commercial and public vehicles.
Precisely tomorrow, the Deputies' Congress will vote on an initiative of the PSOE in which it aims to install this system in school buses, as has already been done in France.
