Through the Personalized Search launched two years ago users e.g. can memorize their browsing history, they can cover what they have been looking for and clicked, these in the long run will generate very better tailor-made results; on this same logic it is based Recommendations with which the system offers us products and services according to our previously declared and recorded preferences.
“Which if my data is being used against me, if they look at what I’m dealing with what I’m dealing with what I’m concerned about Google’s data monopoly.
In most of the cases the counter-reactions of Internet users are provoked by the fright felt by the size of the potential power represented by the company, and not for the sense of guilt, for the fear of punishment, for the desire for freedom or even for the rebellion in power.
However, a fact is confirmed that all the expressions sought are not only recorded but in justified cases they can also be provided to third parties, in such legal cases nothing defends the personal rights of Internet users.
The most egregious example of this in recent times has perhaps been the co-coordinated action against the pedophiles of Brazil, in which Google forwarded to the Brazilian government the information that has made it possible to identify pedophiles from the Orkut community page maintained by Google.
Employees worried about their personal rights instead summoned with relief in May when the company - in agreement with the EFF electronic juridical protection association - has successfully demonstrated the truth in court against the FBI: even later we cannot force Google with any point of the constitution to provide any information secretly requested by the FBI.
