However, the critical observers next to all this find alarming points: for example, the top-of-the-art of the company, for example, has completely rejected the protest of employees after doububling the tuition of corporate kindergarten, has deemed too expensive the repeated catering at the pleasure of the daily pleasure of its employees, but this diminishes in front of the fact that in 2006 Google has bowed the leader of the Chinese government and according to their agreement it will shrew off all the results that detach the good taste.
An internal rule of the company seems not to advertise a new service in advance but only when it will be usable, but one thing is sure, that the foreseeable problems of the next few months and years will move the world at one point: while some believe that the project of scanning and archiving of books and magazines of Google will take on such proportions that the company will soon be in front of the American Supreme Court, others are afraid of the Health system, in fact we can create our medical problems.
“The fact that Google is constructing a gene-basic database can offer good material to the next generation of sci-syncilist writers, the Scroogled’s short-moving short story of Cory Doctorow describes the future with Orwellian accents, in which a man with Google data can be approached in an alarming way.
