Requirements of payments will only take place in a number of instances, in addition, the restrictions depend on how the treasury offers the aid.
In essence, the limitation means that if the ministry buys under an auction, it will impose a surcharge on the golden parachute if they do not retire the lapsed bank manager.
At the time of direct purchase of disproportioned receivables the government will intervene aggressively to ensure that the directors’ money is not exaggerated.
To this it must be added that the already existing contracts of the Golden Parachute will not change, the limitation is valid only for new ones to incentivize the participation in the program.
This is the first case in the American history of the entry into force of a legal limitation concerning the remuneration of the general administrators - the Democrat Barney Frank, chairman of the committee in charge of the financial services of the House of Representatives.
On the other hand, the state has the right to appropriate a share of the banks participating in the program, decreasing the risk of taxpayers, since in the end they can also gain if the economy, and along with it the bailed-in-stancy, will get back on its feet.
